<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Magna downgraded. [CORRECTED 17:53 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Magna downgraded. [CORRECTED 17:53 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said its U.S. priority list committee downgraded Magna International Inc to its recommended list from the priority list. (Corrects to make clear that downgrade made by U.S. priority list committee, rather than analyst Jim Irwin.)</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 50-1/4.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
</text>
